    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκρέκω</span></b> , of stringed instruments, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>answer in sound,</i> i. e.
